NAME: user DJN on an A-field variable
DESCRIPTION: DJN top x with x stored in an A-field decrements that field (.A); i-7d2612-3744e5, see behtests/user_djn_afield.beh
SRC:
(let (x 2)
  (seq
    (JMP (Dir 2))
    (DAT (store x) 0)
    (label top)
    (DJN top x) ))
EXPECTED:
;redcode-94b

  JMP    $2     , #0     
_LET1 
  DAT    #2     , #0     
top   
  DJN.A  $top   , $_LET1 
  DAT    $0     , $0     